                                                "text": "The history of aviation is full of daring pioneers."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5018ac81-ddd0-458e-897c-9b0f5c6fc62f",
                                                "sense_id": "0afbaafa-ba13-3e36-841c-1c77da784824",
                                                "text": "He works in the aviation industry as a pilot."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bcb9a3ac-22ac-4876-b82f-311b2b736456",
                                                "sense_id": "0afbaafa-ba13-3e36-841c-1c77da784824",
                                                "text": "Military aviation played a crucial role in the war."
